  "html": "<p>Ever wanted to be somewhat like Sissirat, where you can infest the enemy with decaying toxins? You might want to be a Poison Mage.\n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Build\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Build</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Skills\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Skills</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Equipment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Equipment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Strategy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Strategy</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Build\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Build</span></h1>\n<p>Pure int getting endurance from gear.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Skills\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Skills</span></h1>\n<p>Your skill list is going to mostly be poison skills with room for wards/resistances and your passives. Keep in mind that you will need a ranger weapon to use this build. A Vis'Kar's Bilespitter or Dhablu Tieff is a wise choice.\n</p><p>Use these skills:\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" title=\"image:Poison-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Poison-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" title=\"image:Noxious-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Noxious-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Left Mouse Button: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Shot\" title=\"Poison Shot\">Poison Shot</a>/Noxious Shot</b> (Either one is a good primary attack)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Acidic-blight.png\" title=\"image:Acidic-blight.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Acidic-blight.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Acidic-blight.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Hotkey 1: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Acidic_Blight\" title=\"Acidic Blight\">Acidic Blight</a></b>\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" title=\"image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Hotkey 2: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Blast\" title=\"Gaseous Blast\">Gaseous Blast</a></b> or you can put Putrid Penetration here.\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" title=\"image:Monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Hotkey 3: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Monster_Bait\" title=\"Monster Bait\">Monster Bait</a></b> (You can replace this with Toxic Talent if you feel you're good at dodging/ have high enough HP).\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Extra-crispy-monster-bait.png\" title=\"image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Extra-crispy-monster-bait.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Hotkey 4: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Crispy_Monster_Bait\" title=\"Extra Crispy Monster Bait\">Extra Crispy Monster Bait</a></b> (Vital at keeping Yum Yums alive, especially during a boss battle!  <br/>             If you skipped Monster Bait,put Spirit of the Hare/Teleport here.)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire-resistance.png\" title=\"image:Fire-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Fire-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>    Hotkey 5: <b>Elemental Resistance</b>\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" title=\"image:Skill- Divine-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Skill- Divine-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Divine-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>Hotkey 6: <b>Elemental Ward</b>\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" title=\"image:Bookworm.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Bookworm.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Bookworm.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>   Hotkey 7: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Bookworm\" title=\"Bookworm\">Bookworm</a></b>\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" title=\"image:Mental-prowess.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Mental-prowess.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Mental-prowess.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>   Hotkey 8: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Prowess\" title=\"Mental Prowess\">Mental Prowess</a></b>\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" title=\"image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\"><img alt=\"image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"42\" src=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>   Right Mouse Button: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Putrid_Penetration\" title=\"Putrid Penetration\">Putrid Penetration</a></b> or Gaseous  Blast\n</p><p>Do NOT use Couch Potato. Sure, you may have more intellect and more MP per point of intellect, but Strength is worthless to this build and the skill brings your HP down even further. Stick with Bookworm.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Equipment\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Equipment</span></h1>\n<p>Now for the gear... I'm only going to list possible RB choices, not every other purple/yellow item. These are just my personal favorites for this build: Experiment with your rainbows to find what's right for you!\n</p><p>Poison Mage Gear:\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shoulders-_Deaths_Disdain.png\" title=\"Shoulders- Death's Disdain.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"45\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shoulders-_Deaths_Disdain.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Death's_Disdain\" title=\"Death's Disdain\">Death's Disdain</a> (Shoulder pads)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gloves-_Death's_Grip.png\" title=\"Gloves- Death's Grip.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gloves-_Death's_Grip.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Death's_Grip\" title=\"Death's Grip\">Death's Grip</a> (Gloves)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Body-_Death's_Habit.png\" title=\"Body- Death's Habit.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/recovered/Body-_Death's_Habit.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Death's_Habit\" title=\"Death's Habit\">Death's Habit</a> (Robe)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Helm-_Death's_Head.png\" title=\"Helm- Death's Head.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/images/recovered/Helm-_Death's_Head.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Death's_Head\" title=\"Death's Head\">Death's Head</a> (Helmet)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Boots-_Death's_Two_Legs.png\" title=\"Boots- Death's Two Legs.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/images/recovered/Boots-_Death's_Two_Legs.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Death's_Two_Legs\" title=\"Death's Two Legs\">Death's Two Legs </a>(Boots)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Amulet-_Honest-to-Goodness_Duality_of_Man.png\" title=\"Amulet- Honest-to-Goodness Duality of Man.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/images/recovered/Amulet-_Honest-to-Goodness_Duality_of_Man.png\" width=\"50\"/></a>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Duality_of_Man\" title=\"Duality of Man\">Honest-to-Goodness Duality of Man</a> (Amulet)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ring-_The_Most_Amazing_Ring_Known_to_Goats.png\" title=\"Ring- The Most Amazing Ring Known to Goats.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ring-_The_Most_Amazing_Ring_Known_to_Goats.png\" width=\"50\"/></a>\n<a href=\"/wiki/The_Most_Amazing_Ring_Known_to_Goats\" title=\"The Most Amazing Ring Known to Goats\">The Most Amazing Ring Known to Goats (Some Assembly Acquired)</a> [I'd use two of these.]\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Dhablu_Tieff.png\" title=\"Dhablu Tieff.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"95\" src=\"/images/recovered/Dhablu_Tieff.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/D'habl'u_Ti'eff\" title=\"D'habl'u Ti'eff\">D'habl'u Ti'eff</a> (Bow) (If you have trouble keeping your health up, this is a good choice.)\n</p><p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-Ranged-_VisKars_Bilespitter.png\" title=\"2h-Ranged- VisKars Bilespitter.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" height=\"75\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-Ranged-_VisKars_Bilespitter.png\" width=\"50\"/></a><a href=\"/wiki/Vis'Kar's_Bilespitter\" title=\"Vis'Kar's Bilespitter\">Vis'Kar's Bilespitter</a> (Bow) (If you would rather maximize damage or feel your HP pool is strong enough, this is the bow of choice)\n</p><p>You are now well briefed on the way of the Poison Mage. I enjoy this build the most out of others and I do well with PKing when I have my Poison Mage.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Strategy\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Strategy</span></h1>\n<p>Some tips:\n</p><p>Keep moving! Your HP is limited by your passives, so don't let yourself become a punching bag!\n</p><p>Don't bother shooting unless it's an emergency! The reason you need a bow is so that you can use these attacks in the first place.\n</p><p>Team up with a Tank Warrior whenever possible. Use them as a meat shield and you will do very well.\n</p><p>This build is also good for pking! Just take out your Monster Bait/Extra Crispy Monster Bait and replace with Heal Self, not Other/Spontaneous Regeneration and you're good to go.\n</p><p>I hope you enjoy this build.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
